                    needs to make confident, strategic decisions.
                </p>
                <p class="text-secondary">
                    Outside of work I enjoy learning new tools via personal projects,
                    picking up new languages and playing with my cat Kiwi.
                    This year I plan to learn freediving with a local diving club.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>